<title>CANADA: AGF debt conversion/redemption results.</title>
<headline>AGF debt conversion/redemption results.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>AGF Management Ltd said on Friday almost all of its C$50 million 6-3/4-percent convertible unsecured subordinated debentures were converted prior to redemption.</p>
<p>AGF said 2,378,070 Class B non-voting equity shares were issued for a total of 12,782,559 Class B non-voting equity shares currently outstanding.</p>
<p>The remaining debentures were redeemed on January 9, 1997.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
